                        "username": "actx4gh"
                    },
                    "message": "This change overlaps with the PATCH-only EthernetInterface privilege change currently listed as a merge conflict.\n\nI kept this change broader within the same Manager EthernetInterface mutation surface: POST, PATCH, and DELETE all mutate Manager-owned network resources, so this patch routes all three to the existing ConfigureManager Manager-specific privilege mappings and adds route-level tests for Operator/Admin behavior.\n\nIf the PATCH-only change lands first, I will rebase this change and retain the remaining POST/DELETE coverage plus the route-level tests."
                }
